  "result": "Excellent! All 62 tests pass. I've implemented the invoice numbering system:\n\n**New module `src/numbering.js`:**\n\n**`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`** \u2013 generates the next invoice number in format `INV-YYYY-CCCC`:\n- Extracts the year from the issue date\n- Finds the highest counter for that year\n- Returns the next sequential number, resetting to 0001 each year\n- Handles malformed numbers gracefully\n\n**New function in `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n**`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)`** \u2013 issues a draft invoice:\n- Assigns the next available number for its year\n- Changes status from 'draft' to 'issued'\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if already issued or in another status\n- Preserves all other invoice fields without mutation\n\n**Tests added:**\n- 10 tests for `nextInvoiceNumber`: year resets, zero-padding, large counters, malformed entries, year boundaries\n- 7 tests for `issueInvoice`: number assignment, status change, field preservation, immutability, non-draft rejection\n\nAll edge cases covered\u2014year boundaries, unsorted existing numbers, and data integrity. \u2705",
